.PS2802-1-F3-A :1 ;The PS2802-1 and PS2802-4 are optically coupled isolators containing a GaAs light emitting diode and an NPN silicon darlington-connected photo transistor in a plastic SSOP for high density applications. This package has shield effect to cut off ambient light.
